WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.6 · Financial Management
Financial controls, approvals and procurement

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
No money should move without a check by someone other than the person moving it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate requesting, approving, paying and checking.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Reconcile the bank monthly; someone else reviews it.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set quote thresholds and declare conflicts.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: supervisor approves up to US$300; directors above; daily cash count; monthly surprise till check.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a control map and procurement thresholds.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
